## GovernorContract — On-Chain Governance (Compound Bravo Compatible)
  Type:           Governor + GovernorCompatibilityBravo + GovernorVotes +
                  GovernorTimelockControl + GovernorCountingSimple + UUPS
  Address:        0x259c1C2354Bc9e1eF20ee3B7b1D8580Cb5F06385
  Voting Token:   AgToken (0x1D31719389Bd8b17277Ba367c26b830aE34D3674)
  Timelock:       ArtifactTimelock (0x662321CC63700865838aB08378061BE499344714)
  Parameters:     (from contract constants)
    Voting Delay:         1 block
    Voting Period:        216,000 blocks (~5 days @ 2s/block on Base)
    Proposal Threshold:   100,000 Ag
    Quorum:               4% of total supply (4,000,000 Ag)
    Quorum Denominator:   100
  Description:    Governance contract for protocol parameter changes, contract
                  upgrades, and fund allocation. Routes through Timelock for
                  execution delay. Compatible with Tally, Snapshot, and Bravo UI.
  Roles:
    DEFAULT_ADMIN:  Treasury Safe
    PROPOSER:       ArtifactTimelock
    UPGRADER:       Treasury Safe
  Verification:   ✅ Verified on Basescan
  Owner:          Treasury Safe (0x1082...9F9e)

## ArtifactTimelock — Governance Timelock Controller
  Type:           TimelockController (OpenZeppelin)
  Address:        0x662321CC63700865838aB08378061BE499344714
  Min Delay:      2 days (172,800 seconds)
  Description:    Enforces time delay between governance proposal passage and
                  execution. Governor has PROPOSER/EXECUTOR/CANCELLER roles.
  Roles:
    Governor:       PROPOSER + EXECUTOR + CANCELLER ✅
    Treasury Safe:  PROPOSER + EXECUTOR ✅
    DEFAULT_ADMIN:  Treasury Safe
  Verification:   ✅ Verified on Basescan
  Owner:          Treasury Safe (0x1082...9F9e)


