## AvOracle v5 — Primary Price Oracle (ACTIVE)
  Type:           TWAP (Time-Weighted Average Price) Oracle
  Address:        0xfd0451a53834E4DAa9626A24B9Aa640B0d3647CD
  Pricing:        TWAP-primary from Aerodrome Slipstream Au/USDC pool
  Current Price:  ~$0.008515 USDC per Au
  Description:    Primary on-chain price oracle. Reads TWAP from Aerodrome
                  Slipstream pool. No Chainlink feed required for Au pricing.
  Verification:   ✅ Verified on Basescan
  Owner:          Treasury Safe (0x1082...9F9e)

## OracleWrapper — Oracle Aggregation & Validation Layer
  Type:           Oracle Aggregator / Validator
  Address:        0xb479760Dfd9Ba90cF670BBB1647a4B06B2032bdB
  Description:    Wraps AvOracle with deviation checks, staleness guards, and
                  reference price comparison. Canonical oracle source for
                  FlashBuy and TreasuryAMO contracts.
  Parameters:     (from contract source)
    Deviation Threshold:  5% (500 bps)
    Max Staleness:        3600 seconds (1 hour)
    Au Reference Price:   1.00 USD (1e18)
    Price Bounds:         1 wei — $1000 (safety bounds)
  Functions:
    getLatestPrice()          → Au price in USDC
    checkDeviation()          → reverts if deviation > threshold
    checkFlashBuyTrigger()    → bool (true if price < trigger)
    emitFlashBuyTrigger()     → emits event
    getAuPriceForAMO()        → formatted for TreasuryAMO
    getAuPriceForFlashBuy()   → formatted for OracleFlashBuy
    setPriceBounds(min, max)  → governance-only
  Roles:
    DEFAULT_ADMIN:  Treasury Safe
    GOVERNANCE:     GovernorContract
  Verification:   ✅ Verified on Basescan
  Owner:          Treasury Safe (0x1082...9F9e)

