  Parameters:
    Trigger Price:    $0.98 (98% of $1.00 peg)
    Max Buyback:      1000 USDC per execution
    Cooldown:         3600 seconds (1 hour)
    Oracle Source:    OracleWrapper (0xb479...32bdB)
