  Implementation: 0xE699960b6e81d00A42F8580004C8FBD72902806A
  Stake Token:    QuasiCrystalLPNFT (ERC-721)
  Reward Token:   Au
  Description:    Staking contract for LP NFTs. Distributes Au rewards to
                  liquidity providers. QuasiCrystal multiplier: veAg-weighted
                  (longer Ag lock = higher multiplier on staking yield).
  Parameters:
    Reward Rate:      Governance-controlled
    QuasiCrystal Multiplier:  veAg-weighted (1.0x–2.5x)
  Roles:
    DEFAULT_ADMIN:    Treasury Safe
    REWARD_MANAGER:   Treasury Safe
    UPGRADER:         Treasury Safe
  Verification:   ✅ Verified on Basescan
  Owner:          Treasury Safe (0x1082...9F9e)

## PID_Emission_Controller_v2 — PID-Controlled Ag Emission
  Type:           PID Controller (UUPS Upgradeable)
  Address:        0x991138923880773D67c01392c31A255e770F7f70
  Description:    Dynamically adjusts Ag emission rates based on TVL deviation
                  from target. Mints Ag to AVLPStaking each epoch.
