    Target TVL:           Governance-controlled
    Epoch Length:         1 week (governance-adjustable)
    Kp (Proportional):    0.1
    Ki (Integral):        0.00005
    Kd (Derivative):      0.05
    Min Emission:         100 Ag per epoch
    Max Emission:         50,000 Ag per epoch
  Roles:
    DEFAULT_ADMIN:  Treasury Safe
    GOVERNANCE:     GovernorContract
    UPGRADER:       Treasury Safe
  Verification:   ✅ Verified on Basescan
  Owner:          Treasury Safe (0x1082...9F9e)


